        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN ARMS EMPIRE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>Werner Waffenwerke</strong> and lead a nearly forgotten arms manufacturer back to the top. Design your own weapons, build factories and research facilities, explore new sales opportunities, and manage the many challenges of running a business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Turn the remains of a once-powerful company into an industrial giant, build the most valuable company in the world, and become the richest person of all time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN YOUR OWN WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your own weapons and research new technologies. Decide which products your company will develop and manufacture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR COMPANY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new factories and research facilities and gradually expand your production and development capabilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR CUSTOMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your weapons through different channels to a wide range of customers and make sure your factories never stand still.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN YOUR COMPANY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Werner Waffenwerke through the many challenges of everyday business. Keep an eye on your company, make economic decisions, and lay the foundation for further growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISE TO THE TOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a small branch into a powerful industrial corporation. Keep expanding your company, increase its value, and fight your way to the top of the global economy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE LEGACY OF WERNER WAFFENWERKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the spoiled sole heir of a once-powerful industrial family. After the death of your grandfather, you inherit an arms manufacturer whose history is buried in the turmoil of the 1940s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The family's great wealth is long gone, with only crumbs of its former fortune remaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather, <strong>Wilhelm Werner Werner</strong>, has left you practically nothing – except ownership of <strong>Werner Waffenwerke</strong>, a few million dollars, a small branch of the once-mighty company somewhere in a small European country, and, of course, his beloved mascot <strong>Werner Wombat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is remarkably simple – at least on paper:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Werner Waffenwerke back to its place in the sun.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SOLO DEV PROJECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Werner Waffenwerke: Arms Tycoon</strong> is developed by me as a solo developer. Feedback, ideas, and suggestions from the community are always welcome and help shape the future development of the game.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN ARMS EMPIRE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>Werner Waffenwerke</strong> and lead a nearly forgotten arms manufacturer back to the top. Design your own weapons, build factories and research facilities, explore new sales opportunities, and manage the many challenges of running a business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Turn the remains of a once-powerful company into an industrial giant, build the most valuable company in the world, and become the richest person of all time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN YOUR OWN WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your own weapons and research new technologies. Decide which products your company will develop and manufacture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR COMPANY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new factories and research facilities and gradually expand your production and development capabilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR CUSTOMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your weapons through different channels to a wide range of customers and make sure your factories never stand still.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN YOUR COMPANY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Werner Waffenwerke through the many challenges of everyday business. Keep an eye on your company, make economic decisions, and lay the foundation for further growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISE TO THE TOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a small branch into a powerful industrial corporation. Keep expanding your company, increase its value, and fight your way to the top of the global economy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE LEGACY OF WERNER WAFFENWERKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the spoiled sole heir of a once-powerful industrial family. After the death of your grandfather, you inherit an arms manufacturer whose history is buried in the turmoil of the 1940s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The family's great wealth is long gone, with only crumbs of its former fortune remaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandfather, <strong>Wilhelm Werner Werner</strong>, has left you practically nothing – except ownership of <strong>Werner Waffenwerke</strong>, a few million dollars, a small branch of the once-mighty company somewhere in a small European country, and, of course, his beloved mascot <strong>Werner Wombat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is remarkably simple – at least on paper:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Werner Waffenwerke back to its place in the sun.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SOLO DEV PROJECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Werner Waffenwerke: Arms Tycoon</strong> is developed by me as a solo developer. Feedback, ideas, and suggestions from the community are always welcome and help shape the future development of the game.</p>",
        "short_description": "Build your own armaments empire. Develop customised weapons, build and expand factories, manage staff, production and finances, and sell your products on the global market. Transform a run-down family business into the world’s most valuable corporation.",
